    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bobcos</strong> is a vibrant 2D online multiplayer sandbox game where you can create, explore, and express yourself. Build your own personal world using blocks and decorative items, shape the environment to your liking, and bring your imagination to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From peaceful forests to bustling towns, your world is entirely yours to design. Customize your avatar with a wide variety of outfits, accessories, and hairstyles. Visit other players' worlds, chat, explore, and form friendships in a lively and welcoming community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade items with friends, go fishing, and unlock rare collectibles. The game features a persistent online world\u2014your progress, builds, and collections are always saved, even when you're offline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a builder, a collector, or someone who just wants to chill with others in a cozy virtual world, Bobcos offers a relaxing and endlessly creative multiplayer experience. With seasonal events and frequent updates, there\u2019s always something new to discover.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bobcos</strong> is a vibrant 2D online multiplayer sandbox game where you can create, explore, and express yourself. Build your own personal world using blocks and decorative items, shape the environment to your liking, and bring your imagination to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From peaceful forests to bustling towns, your world is entirely yours to design. Customize your avatar with a wide variety of outfits, accessories, and hairstyles. Visit other players' worlds, chat, explore, and form friendships in a lively and welcoming community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade items with friends, go fishing, and unlock rare collectibles. The game features a persistent online world\u2014your progress, builds, and collections are always saved, even when you're offline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a builder, a collector, or someone who just wants to chill with others in a cozy virtual world, Bobcos offers a relaxing and endlessly creative multiplayer experience. With seasonal events and frequent updates, there\u2019s always something new to discover.</p>",
    "short_description": "Bobcos is a 2D multiplayer sandbox game where you can build your own world, trade with others, fish, chat, and customize your avatar. Create personal worlds, run shops, and explore a persistent online world with seasonal events and regular updates.",
